# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. Files in public/ are copied verbatim into
# dist/, so this needs no build configuration.
#
# Not optional, and not merely cosmetic. Every link this app hands out is a deep
# one opened *cold*, by someone who has never loaded the site in this tab:
#
#   /join/THR-8K2QF      scanned off a QR code at registration
#   /t/{id}              texted round by the organiser
#   /r/{id}/g/{groupId}  followed on a tee box
#
# Pages resolves a request against the built files before any JavaScript runs, and
# none of those paths exist on disk. Without this line each one answers 404 and
# React never gets the chance to route it — the invite mechanism looks broken to
# exactly the people it was sent to.
#
# 200, not 301: the URL must stay as it was so the router can read it.
/*  /index.html  200
